      "Preventive controls focus on blocking initial entry or exploit vectors before the malware can payload into system folders.",
      "Recovery controls are utilized to restore files and rebuild OS configurations after the threat has compromised systems.",
      "Administrative control represents an operational mechanism classification rather than an actionable purpose category."
