    "id": "ISC2-CC-CQ-06-016",
    "chapterIndex": 5,
    "text": "A professional who holds a Certified Public Accountant (CPA) license witnesses an ISC2 member deliberately bad-mouthing the entire security community and degrading its standards. Does the CPA have standing to complain under Canon 4?",
