    "id": "ISC2-CC-CQ-09-008",
    "chapterIndex": 8,
    "text": "A critical application server fails on Friday morning. The backup strategy consists of a full backup on Sunday night and differential backups every subsequent night at midnight. Which backup files are required to restore the system?",
