    "id": "ISC2-CC-CQ-09-014",
    "chapterIndex": 8,
    "text": "An organization wants to conduct a rigorous disaster recovery test where alternative systems are spun up at a warm site and backup data is restored to confirm operational readiness, while the primary production data center remains active and unaffected. What test type is this?",
