    "id": "ISC2-CC-CQ-17-017",
    "chapterIndex": 16,
    "text": "A company migrates its database backend to a public cloud provider's managed database service. Under the shared responsibility model for a PaaS database offering, who is primarily responsible for patching the underlying database engine software and securing the host operating system?",
