    "id": "ISC2-CC-CQ-17-020",
    "chapterIndex": 16,
    "text": "An organization deploying applications across a public cloud environment wants to ensure that data stored at rest in cloud storage buckets is completely unreadable if compromised by an unauthorized actor. Which security control should be implemented?",
