    "id": "ISC2-CC-CQ-17-027",
    "chapterIndex": 16,
    "text": "An e-commerce company experiences a massive surge in website traffic during a holiday flash sale. The cloud infrastructure automatically spins up additional virtual server instances to handle the load and scales them back down when traffic subsides. This is an example of which cloud principle?",
